This package ships the Explorer sources, including inline icons adapted in part
from Feather Icons. Vue is installed separately by npm and bundled when the
Explorer page is built. The notices for both are included below. Directly
vendored material is recorded in third-party-sources.json.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vue, in the Explorer page of Kkdev92.Tisilia.Explorer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Explorer is a web page built with Vue, and the built page that
Kkdev92.Tisilia.Explorer embeds and serves contains these Vue packages:
@vue/reactivity, @vue/runtime-core, @vue/runtime-dom and @vue/shared. The build
also writes the list, with versions, beside the page
(third-party-licenses.json). They are licensed as follows:

